TI  - Ceftazidime-Avibactam Treatment for Carbapenemase-Producing Enterobacterales in a 
      South African Children's Hospital.
PG  - 541-546
LID - 10.1093/jpids/piae087 [doi]
AB  - This study describes ceftazidime-avibactam use in 17 young children from a 
      resource-constrained country, where intra-abdominal infection was common. 
      All-cause mortality was 53%. Earlier initiation, dose optimization, recording 
      infusion times, and reviewing the need for additional antibiotics were identified 
      as easy-to-implement-antimicrobial-stewardship interventions.
